        <mxCell id="ag2_d" parent="zone_pipeline" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="• Calls cleartool lshistory -minor -fmt for every element&#xa;• Groups versions → git commits by (branch, author, comment, 60-sec window)&#xa;• UCM mode: one activity = one commit; resolves merge arrows → merge parents&#xa;• Outputs: workspace/commits.json  (37 commits in sample)" vertex="1">
